---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Mini games" image="/images/play-sideline-slide.jpg" description="Mini games from Doubleskull Tales: throw a goblin through Krampusbowl weather, slide as close to the sideline as you dare, or hold the line as a Flesh Golem.">
  <div class="page pl-page">
    <p class="pl-kicker">Play in your browser</p>
    <h1>Mini games</h1>
    <p class="pl-intro"><em>Three ways to lose a player before kick-off. All run in your browser, all are free, and all keep your best score only on your device.</em></p>

    <!-- Newest game first: put a new game at the top with class "pl-new" and remove "pl-new" from the previous one. -->
    <div class="pl-grid">
      <a class="pl-card pl-new" href="/play/plant-your-feet/">
        <img class="pl-img" src="/images/flesh-golem-sideline.jpg" alt="A red, spiky beast tries to shove a stitched-together golem into a rowdy crowd at the sideline." width="1376" height="768" />
        <span class="pl-label"><span class="pl-badge">New</span> Stand Firm</span>
        <span class="pl-title">Plant Your Feet</span>
        <span class="pl-text">You are a Flesh Golem with your back to the crowd. A Blood Beast with Frenzy wants you in the stands. Hold your ground, or give way on purpose and spring the trap.</span>
        <span class="pl-best" data-key="dst-plant-your-feet-best" data-unit="points" data-dec="0"></span>
        <span class="btn dark pl-btn">Play Plant Your Feet</span>
      </a>
      <a class="pl-card" href="/play/sideline-slide/">
        <img class="pl-img" src="/images/play-sideline-slide.jpg" alt="A werewolf, an elf and a ratman slide across a frozen pitch towards the sideline and a cheering crowd." width="1200" height="670" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="pl-label">Frozen Pitch</span>
        <span class="pl-title">Sideline Slide</span>
        <span class="pl-text">Werewolf, Wardancer or Gutter Runner: sprint onto the ice and slide as close to the sideline as you dare. One square too far and the crowd rolls for injury.</span>
        <span class="pl-best" data-key="dst-sideline-slide-best"></span>
        <span class="btn dark pl-btn">Play Sideline Slide</span>
      </a>
      <a class="pl-card" href="/play/goblin-toss/">
        <img class="pl-img" src="/images/play-goblin-toss.jpg" alt="A troll throws a panicking goblin across a snowy pitch towards a cheering crowd." width="1200" height="670" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="pl-label">Throw Team-mate</span>
        <span class="pl-title">Goblin Toss</span>
        <span class="pl-text">Pick a big guy and a small volunteer, then throw him as far as you can. The Krampusbowl weather table rolls before every throw.</span>
        <span class="pl-best" data-key="dst-goblin-toss-best"></span>
        <span class="btn dark pl-btn">Play Goblin Toss</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="pl-fine">Illustrations: AI-generated.</p>

    <p>The stories behind the games:</p>
    <div class="cta-row"><a class="play-cta" href="/tales/flesh-golem-hommage/"><img src="/images/head-flesh-golem.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy"><span class="play-cta-text"><span class="play-cta-label">Coaching Corner</span><span class="play-cta-title">Stitched Together, Standing Firm</span><span class="play-cta-sub">A love letter to the Flesh Golem, plus a bow to Frank 'n' Stein.</span></span><span class="btn dark play-cta-btn">Read the tale</span></a><a class="play-cta" href="/tales/krampusbowl-weather/"><img src="/images/head-krampusbowl-weather.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy"><span class="play-cta-text"><span class="play-cta-label">Coaching Corner</span><span class="play-cta-title">Brisk, With a Chance of Broken Ribs</span><span class="play-cta-sub">What the Krampusbowl weather table does to every team.</span></span><span class="btn dark play-cta-btn">Read the tale</span></a></div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .pl-kicker { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--red); }
    .pl-intro { font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .pl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin: 1.6em 0 2em; }
    .pl-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-top-width: 10px; padding: 20px 22px 22px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; background: var(--paper-dark, #e4d9c1); }
    .pl-card:hover { border-top-color: var(--red); color: var(--ink); }
    .pl-img { display: block; width: calc(100% + 44px); max-width: none; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1200 / 670; object-fit: cover; margin: -20px -22px 6px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    .pl-fine { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: -1.2em; }
    .pl-label { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); }
    .pl-title { font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .pl-text { font-size: 1.1rem; flex: 1; }
    .pl-best { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); min-height: 1em; }
    .pl-btn { text-align: center; }
    .pl-card:hover .pl-btn { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); color: var(--paper); }
    .pl-new { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto auto; column-gap: 26px; row-gap: 10px; border-top-color: var(--red); }
    .pl-new .pl-img { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / -1; width: calc(100% + 22px); height: calc(100% + 42px); aspect-ratio: auto; margin: -20px 0 -22px -22px; border-bottom: none; border-right: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    .pl-new > *:not(.pl-img) { grid-column: 2; }
    .pl-badge { display: inline-block; background: var(--red); color: var(--paper, #efe6d2); padding: 2px 7px; margin-right: 6px; letter-spacing: .15em; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .pl-new { display: flex; }
      .pl-new .pl-img { width: calc(100% + 44px); height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1200 / 670; margin: -20px -22px 6px; border-right: none; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { .pl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>

  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelectorAll('.pl-best').forEach(function (el) {
      try {
        var b = parseFloat(localStorage.getItem(el.dataset.key));
        var by = localStorage.getItem(el.dataset.key + '-by');
        var unit = el.dataset.unit || 'squares', dec = el.dataset.dec ? parseInt(el.dataset.dec, 10) : 1;
        if (!isNaN(b)) el.textContent = 'Your best: ' + b.toFixed(dec) + ' ' + unit + (by ? ' (' + by + ')' : '');
      } catch (e) {}
    });
  </script>
</Base>
